# Keep secrets, local environments and test/scratch files out of Docker build contexts.
# (The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`; without this file a local `docker build` would copy
# backend/.env, with its credentials, into the image.)
# Patterns use **/ so they also match inside sub-folders (Docker anchors plain patterns at the
# context root). Data folders the app uses at run time (reviewer_seed/, uploads/, migrations/,
# scripts/) are deliberately NOT excluded.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
venv/
.venv/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
tests/
**/*.log
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
